{"type":"message","id":"5d6abaf5","parentId":"d08ccaf0","timestamp":"2026-03-11T00:48:44.706Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:e1b719dc-47fb-45f7-b4b2-c36742813ce6 vault-sync] Sync the Obsidian vault: 1) cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A 2) If there are changes, commit with message including current timestamp (format: \"Vault auto-save $(date +'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')\") 3) git push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/tera-vault. Report only if there were changes and the push succeeded.\nCurrent time: Wednesday, March 11th, 2026 — 12:48 AM (UTC) / 2026-03-11 00:48 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773190124701}}
{"type":"message","id":"bac66ab5","parentId":"5d6abaf5","timestamp":"2026-03-11T00:48:50.649Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job to sync the Obsidian vault. I need to:\n1. cd to ~/obsidian-vault and run git add -A\n2. Check if there are changes\n3. If there are, commit with timestamp and push\n\nLet me run these commands.","thinkingSignature":"5d49307232bbdeebeb950a22827bdd68e89c1c8868ca0f472dab75510b482b24"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6ib0vyflcf9q_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A && git diff --staged --quiet && echo \"NO_CHANGES\" || echo \"HAS_CHANGES\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":32,"output":115,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":15267,"totalTokens":15414,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773190124703}}
